# D7 — remaining sequence and autonomous preparation

**Date:** 2026-09-13
**Status:** accepted (workflow/design only)
**Actor:** current-session plan designer; concrete revision model/route not attested
**Evidence:** RAG:— [owner request](../brief/01-remaining-sequence-owner-request.md#owner-request) and [autonomy steering](../brief/01-remaining-sequence-owner-request.md#autonomy-steering); existing phase specs, D2, D6 and qualification packet §2–8.
